[PATTERNS]
 D1   0.5  0.8  1.2  1.6  1.4  1.0
 D2   1.0  1.2  1.4  0.8  0.6  0.4

[RULES]
RULE R1
IF TANK T1 LEVEL ABOVE 4.5
AND SYSTEM CLOCKTIME >= 2 AM
THEN PIPE P5 STATUS IS CLOSED
ELSE PIPE P5 STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 2

RULE R2
IF JUNCTION J3 PRESSURE < 15
OR JUNCTION J4 DEMAND > 30
THEN VALVE V1 SETTING = 1.5
PRIORITY 1

RULE R3
IF SYSTEM TIME > 6
AND TANK T1 DRAINTIME < 3
THEN PIPE P5 STATUS IS OPEN
AND VALVE V1 STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 3

RULE R4
IF LINK P2 FLOW >= 60
AND SYSTEM DEMAND > 50
AND LINK P5 STATUS IS OPEN
THEN PIPE P7 STATUS IS CLOSED
ELSE PIPE P7 STATUS IS OPEN

RULE R5
IF NODE J1 HEAD <= 70
OR TANK T1 FILLTIME > 20
THEN VALVE V1 SETTING = 5

[QUALITY]

[TIMES]
 Duration           18:00
 Hydraulic Timestep 1:00
 Quality Timestep   0:10
 Pattern Timestep   3:00
 Report Timestep    1:00
 Rule Timestep      0:15
 Start ClockTime    1 AM

[OPTIONS]
 Units             CMH
 Headloss          C-M
 Pressure          Meters
 Quality           Trace J2
 Demand Model      PDA
 Minimum Pressure  5
 Required Pressure 20
 Pressure Exponent 0.5
 Emitter Exponent  0.6
 Backflow Allowed  No
 Demand Multiplier 1.2
 CheckFreq         3
 MaxCheck          12
 DampLimit         0.01

[END]
